{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 30/09/2024. The use of the outbuilding as a self-contained dwelling at 4 Wentworth Road, UB2 5TS was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\n\nThe application in respect of the use of the existing outbuilding as a self-contained dwelling at 4 Wentworth Road, UB2 5TS would comply with Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act (as amended) and the use would be lawful. The evidence supplied establishes that on the balance of probabilities the outbuilding has been in place for an uninterrupted period of at least four years and used as a self-contained dwelling."
  ],
